WEBVTT

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.600
A picture book with driving controls.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:16.000
The steering-wheel part is seated in a fixture,
pressed, then removed for a look.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:28.800
The printed gear-selector label is aligned
and smoothed into its recess.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:36.600
A driver fastens the electronics assembly
to the red housing.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:45.000
The operator solders individual leads
inside the dashboard module.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:57.000
The wheel area is located in the housing
and fastened from the back.

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:02.000
Front and rear housings are aligned
and brought together.

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:13.200
The operator exercises the dashboard controls.
Indicator lights respond.

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:19.800
The operator aligns the printed pages
with the cover and presses them in place.

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:26.200
Adhesive strips are prepared
on the back of the dashboard.

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:30.800
The assembled book comes out
of the pressing station.

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:37.800
An operator opens and turns
the illustrated pages during inspection.

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:43.900
The operator folds and tapes
a shipping carton before loading.

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:47.700
Wrapped books are placed
into the shipping carton.

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:51.300
Sealed cartons are staged together.
